  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help rescue children from sexual violence in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Free a Girl fights sexual exploitation of children (SEC). Since 2008, we have rescued over 6000 minor girls. We investigate potential cases, conduct rescue raids with local police and provide immediate aftercare, such as safe shelter, counseling, and medical care, but also education and vocational training. With your help, we will do absolutely everything we can to rescue these girls, help them recover, fight for justice, and put every exploiter behind bars.</narrative>
  </description>
